{"4252140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "It's Spreading", "steam_appid": 4252140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Spreading is a game that I've made for the Pirate Software Game Jam of 2024.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game where you start off trying to find a hidden entity taking over the ship and when it's finally revealed, it's action time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game the entity is hiding as an object in the ship and each time you play the object is randomly assigned. It can also be almost anything that is in the ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be fast paced and replayable, average game time is about 2-3 minutes each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was made inside of UE5 using assets from the Marketplace and Audio and Images from Pixabay.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Spreading is a game that I've made for the Pirate Software Game Jam of 2024.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game where you start off trying to find a hidden entity taking over the ship and when it's finally revealed, it's action time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game the entity is hiding as an object in the ship and each time you play the object is randomly assigned. It can also be almost anything that is in the ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be fast paced and replayable, average game time is about 2-3 minutes each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was made inside of UE5 using assets from the Marketplace and Audio and Images from Pixabay.</p>", "short_description": "It's Spreading is a game where you are trying to find a hidden entity taking over the ship and when it's finally revealed, it's action time! In the game the entity is hiding as an object in the ship and each time you play the object is randomly assigned. Designed to be fast paced and replayable.", "supported_languages": "English"